	<div class="thumbinner" style="width:627px;"><img alt="" class="thumbimage" data-file-height="552" data-file-width="1296" height="266" width="625" src="/upload.wikimedia.org/Wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/49/Distance_and_Energy.JPG/625px-Distance_and_Energy.JPG" />

